# Local config and generated reports. These patterns need the ** prefix: a rule
# containing a slash is anchored to this file's directory, so the old
# "e2e-standards/..." spelling never matched agent-orchestration/e2e-standards/.
**/e2e-standards/config.env
**/e2e-standards/reports/
node_modules/
